{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
When an enemy deals direct damage to you, apply {c_random}{dot:DOT_TOOLTIP}{/c} Poisoning damage to them over {c_number}{SF_0}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
When you take damage from a Damage Over Time effect, you have a {c_number}[{SF_12}*100|%|]{/c} chance to be Healed instead, increased by {c_number}[{SF_8}*100|%|]{/c} of your Poison Resistance from bonuses, up to a maximum of {c_random}[{SF_20}*100|%|]{/c}.
Current Chance: {c_number}[{SF_7}*100|2%|]{/c}{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
